Warning [E2931] (duplicate_accessible_label): Two interactive nodes both have the label "Submit"
  --> tests/ui_lint/a11y_duplicate_label.jet:5:13
    |
  5 |     backend.set_focus_group([
    |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Assistive tech announces controls by their label — identical labels make them indistinguishable (WCAG 2.5.3).
 Fix: Give each interactive node a distinct, descriptive label.
